    "content_html": "<img class=\" wp-image-365 aligncenter\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/gln.jpg\" alt=\"gln\" width=\"157\" height=\"106\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The judging panel has drawn attention to the outstanding negotiation skills of this firm’s banking and finance group, and Gide Loyrette Nouel is our 2013 winner in France</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founded in 1920, the firm now has 600 lawyers operating throughout the world. Last year GLN advised HSBC France on the first mortgage bond to be list on Euronext, Paris.</p>",
